applied to the pinned commit by mineai/fetch-and-patch.sh (or scripts/mineai-fetch.mjs); git apply skips these lines.
0011: build_structure on rough ground gives up on no cell the bot can reach. The Muse re-test on staging (2026-10-08,
game g42b738) left 1-3 cells of three hut_3x3 and a shelter "refused" in a gravel pocket its iron route had dug:
"search timed out after 2000 ms compute; no path or usable partial route found", the closest node within reach of the
cell. Causes, each reproduced on Paper at that spot (same seed): a route out of the hut put dirt scaffolding into a
wall cell it had just dug, which then had no face the bot could see; a search for any workable cell that failed gave up
on whichever cell was nearest the bot, not the one it was for; a roof cell of stone buried by its neighbours could not
be dug from anywhere. On a slope a hut whose walls stood over a drop placed none of its 23 blocks ("nothing solid to
place against"), and standing in a pond a hut's door and inside cells held water, which a dig settled at once without
removing, so the loop never yielded and the supervisor's watchdog ended the runtime (RUNTIME_UNRESPONSIVE). Now: a route
never puts scaffolding into a cell of the structure; a cell the composite route cannot reach is tried from up to 3
places to stand within reach of it (open now, nearest the bot first, a dig only where a face of it can be seen), each
route with a 5 s search (sliced, as every search, between turns of the event loop), 12 such routes a run at most, and
only that cell is given up on ("unreachable", with what was tried); a cell with nothing to place against gets a column
of up to 4 blocks under it from the ground (a carried scaffold block that is not a material of the structure, else
spare material); a wall or roof cell of solid ground that cannot be dug out keeps its block ("kept", counted done); a
cell asked to be air that holds water is left as water (counted done); a cell dug 3 times that fills again is given
up on; every cell worked yields to the event loop first. The audit gains kept, water and supports, and "1 was
refused", not "1 were refused". With tests (build-process, build-structure, movement-policy).

